<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">For other factors that may cause actual results to differ materially
from those projected and anticipated in forward-looking statements in this Current Report on Form&nbsp;8-K, please refer to Axcelis&rsquo;
most recent Annual Report on Form&nbsp;10-K and Veeco&rsquo;s most recent Annual Report on Form&nbsp;10-K, and other subsequent filings
with the SEC made by Axcelis and/or Veeco. Unless required by law, we assume no obligation to, and do not currently intend to, update
these forward-looking statements.</P>

